Z||000000||Philphine||06-23-2001||03:00 PM||||<BR>and maybe send me a soap on a rope too. it's a matter of time before i'm arrested. got a ticket for having my stereo too loud in my truck. the cop said there's a new ordinance that makes loud stereo an arrestable offence. apparently they did some neighboorhood focus groups and somehow loud stereos were a worse problem than any of the various crimes that go on in the city. so if i'm stopped for it again i'll be arrested, have my vehicle impounded, and have to have the system removed.<P>i had a car stereo before i had a car to put it in. i love car stereo. i also like to let it breath a little sometimes. 41 years pretty much on the right side of the law and my downfall will be gittin' my thump on.<P>aw well...hope my future cellmate isn't too big and dosen't look at me funny. <P>------------------<BR>Phil T<P>'87 coupe (feral)<BR>'84 indy<BR>'84 coupe (cheap thrill)<BR>'84 chop top (project. or at least an interesting collection of parts)||||reg||1
