Z||000007||rogergarrison||06-23-2001||06:55 PM||||Im with you on that wampus. If you want your loud music, do it where I cant hear it. I hate having someone elses choice of music forced on me. I have a never ending war with them in the car wash next to me. I have a 2000 watt amp with 12" speakers in my outside garage wall to give them the hint. If they dont turn it down pretty quick, I just call the cops, they know me by name now. If its still playing when they get here they get a $100 fine. Play them out in the country on the hiway, your house, or anywhere else away from the public. I like to hear my tv when Im only sitting 6 feet away. Sorry if this is too long, but this is one of my main gripes. They ruined the Carlisle Show last 2 years, thank god the Carlisle people realized this and made them take a different date, when the normal Import, Kitcar and Fiero show was barely attended in 2000.||||reg||1
